## Requirements

`REQUIREMENTS.md` is the standing, numbered requirement set — the contract this project
commits to. New behaviour starts as a requirement diff, then tagged tests, then code; a
row is `implemented` only when a test named in its evidence cell pins it. A full
`uv run pytest` fails when a status and the suite disagree.

`docs/code-map.md` is generated from the import graph and each module's contract header:
`uv run python scripts/code_map.py` rewrites it, `--check` fails when it is stale, and
`--impact <file...>` prints a change's blast radius. Coverage and layers are declared in
`code-map.config.json`.

`uv run python scripts/readme_check.py` holds this README to the same standard (G-012):
every command, path, flag and script name here has to exist, and `--list` prints what it
checks.

